+- SHOULD block access to localhost/private IP ranges/link-local addresses and cloud metadata endpoints. For public-only Go egress, `netip.Addr.IsPrivate` plus global-unicast/link-local checks is not a complete allowlist: explicitly exclude deprecated IPv6 site-local `fec0::/10`, and test `fec0::1` and `feff::1` are rejected before dialing (86bccndx6 RED/GREEN and guard-mutation receipts; [Go netip semantics](https://pkg.go.dev/net/netip#Addr.IsPrivate)).
 - MUST restrict schemes to `http`/`https` (no `file:`, `gopher:`, etc.).
 - MUST set client timeouts and restrict redirects.
 
